stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle

    idle --> walk : velX > 0.5
    idle --> sit : idleTime > 8s
    walk --> run : velX > 4
    walk --> idle : velX near 0
    run --> walk : velX < 4
    run --> idle : velX near 0
    sit --> lie_down : idleTime > 16s
    sit --> idle : any input
    lie_down --> idle : any input

    idle --> jump_rise : jump pressed
    walk --> jump_rise : jump pressed
    run --> jump_rise : jump pressed
    jump_rise --> jump_air : velY peak
    jump_air --> jump_fall : velY < 0
    jump_fall --> jump_land : grounded
    jump_land --> idle : 0.2s

    idle --> attack_prep : attack pressed
    walk --> attack_prep : attack pressed
    attack_prep --> attack_1 : 0.17s
    attack_1 --> attack_2 : 0.08s bark_fire
    attack_2 --> attack_end : 0.17s
    attack_end --> idle : 0.17s

    idle --> hurt_light : damage lv1
    idle --> hurt_medium : damage lv2
    idle --> hurt_heavy : damage lv3
    hurt_light --> idle : 0.25s
    hurt_medium --> idle : 0.4s
    hurt_heavy --> idle : 0.6s
    hurt_heavy --> death : if dead

    death --> [*]
